    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d440">

                <pb facs="0533" n="445" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg445"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Griscom.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-04-14"><hi rendition="#italic">April 14,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 53.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose herewith for your information a
                    copy of a dispatch from Mr. Lambert, vice-consul, in charge of the American
                    consulate <pb facs="0534" n="446" xml:id="pg446"/> at Tamsui, reporting the
                    punitive measures taken against the Botel Tobago natives for their ill treatment
                    of the crew of the American ship <hi rendition="#italic">Benjamin
                    Sewall.</hi></p>
                <p>You will call the attention of the Japanese Government to the three suggestions
                    which Mr. Lambert makes.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d440-a1.xml" xpointer="d440-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
